WEBVTT

00:00:03.068 --> 00:00:05.010
<b>How much</b> sugar do you eat?

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:06.096
<b>A lot.</b>

00:00:06.323 --> 00:00:07.845
I eat <b>a lot</b> of sugar.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:09.653
A little.

00:00:09.784 --> 00:00:11.300
I eat <b>a little</b> sugar.

00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:13.208
<b>Not much.</b>

00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:14.625
I do<b>n’t</b> eat <b>much</b> sugar.

00:00:15.483 --> 00:00:16.223
<b>None.</b>

00:00:16.506 --> 00:00:18.186
I do<b>n’t</b> eat <b>any</b> sugar.

00:00:20.344 --> 00:00:22.292
<b>How many</b> cookies do you eat?

00:00:23.169 --> 00:00:23.729
<b>A lot.</b>

00:00:24.019 --> 00:00:25.610
I eat <b>a lot</b> of cookies.

00:00:26.461 --> 00:00:27.275
<b>A few.</b>

00:00:27.498 --> 00:00:28.979
I eat <b>a few</b> cookies.

00:00:29.969 --> 00:00:30.858
<b>Not many.</b>

00:00:30.973 --> 00:00:32.653
I do<b>n’t</b> eat <b>many</b> cookies.

00:00:33.657 --> 00:00:34.353
<b>None.</b>

00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:36.486
I do<b>n’t</b> eat <b>any</b> cookies.